			<tr><td><a href="img/satoyama046.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/satoyama046_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama046.jpg" --></a><a href="img/satoyama045.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/satoyama045_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama045.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">大型サイズの動物ということで、サイズはラインナップ中で最大。<br />
				細かな毛のディテールが良い。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/satoyama042.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/satoyama042_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama042.jpg" --></a><a href="img/satoyama052.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/satoyama052_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama052.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment"><a href="../../nature_of_japan/noj1">
				日本のいきもの01</a>のヒグマにはそのサイズに驚きましたが、今回もサイズに驚きました。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/satoyama047.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/satoyama047_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama047.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">いやぁ<a href="../../../anima/anima_japVIII">こんなツキノワグマもいました</a>なぁ。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="10">やまどり</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/satoyama038.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/satoyama038_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama038.jpg" --></a><a href="img/satoyama039.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/satoyama039_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama039.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/satoyama040.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/satoyama040_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama040.jpg" --></a><a href="img/satoyama041.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/satoyama041_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama041.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">やはり特筆すべきは細かな羽根の模様でしょう。<br />
				さすがにこのサイズで細い鳥の脚は無理、というわけで潔く畳んでいます。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/satoyama037.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/satoyama037_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama037.jpg" --></a><a href="img/satoyama049.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/satoyama049_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/micro/satoyama/img/satoyama049.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment"><a href="../../nature_of_japan/noj3">
				日本のいきもの03</a>のスズメと。このサイズでも立体化してほしいな。</td></tr>
